Table full name: NEW_YORK_NOAA.NEW_YORK.TREE_CENSUS_2005
Column name: sidw_raise Type: TEXT Description: Raised sidewalk present
Column name: location_1 Type: TEXT
Column name: wire_other Type: TEXT Description: Indicates the presence of other wires
Column name: pit_type Type: TEXT
Column name: wire_2nd Type: TEXT Description: Indicates the presence of secondary wires
Column name: vert_wall Type: TEXT Description: Walled tree well present
Column name: spc_common Type: TEXT Description: The common name of the species.
Column name: borocode Type: NUMBER Description: Borough tree is in, using a one-digit borough code: 1 – Manhattan, 2 – Bronx, 3 – Brooklyn, 4 – Queens, 5 – Staten Island
Column name: spc_latin Type: TEXT Description: The scientific name of the species.
Column name: cb_num Type: NUMBER Description: Community Board that the tree falls in.
Column name: zip_city Type: TEXT Description: City, as derived from the zipcode
Column name: nta_name Type: TEXT Description: Nta name for the neighborhood tabulation area the tree point is in
Column name: inf_wires Type: TEXT Description: Choking wires present
Column name: inf_paving Type: TEXT Description: Close paving present
Column name: inf_lights Type: TEXT Description: Tree lights present
Column name: vert_other Type: TEXT Description: Other Vertical Treatment Present
Column name: status Type: TEXT Description: Excellent: full, well balanced crown and limb structure; leaves normal size color; no dead or broken branches; trunk solid; bark intact. Good: crown uneven or misshapen; some mechanical damage to bark or trunk; some signs of insects or disease; leaves somewhat below normal size and quantity; some dead or broken branches (less than half of the tree). Poor: large dead limbs with over one- half of the tree already dead or removed; large cavities; drastic deformities; leaves significantly below normal size and quantity; severe insect or disease damage. Dead: dead tree; leaves absent; twigs brittle. Shaft: all branches removed; trunk left standing; sprouts may or may not be evident. Stump: stump shorter than breast height; leaves entirely absent or present only on stump sprouts Empty pit: Pit contains exposed soil and no tree
Column name: inf_guard Type: TEXT Description: Choking guard or grate present
Column name: sidw_crack Type: TEXT Description: Cracked sidewalk present
Column name: nta Type: TEXT Description: nta code for the neighborhood tabulation area the tree point is in, from the 2010 census
Column name: st_assem Type: NUMBER Description: State Assembly District tree point is in.
Column name: soil_lvl Type: TEXT
Column name: st_senate Type: NUMBER Description: State Senate District tree point is in.
Column name: boro_ct Type: NUMBER Description: This is the boro_ct identifier for the census tract that the tree point falls into.
Column name: vert_tgrd Type: TEXT Description: Tall guard present
Column name: horz_other Type: TEXT Description: Other horizontal treatment present
Column name: inf_canopy Type: TEXT Description: Canopy debris present
Column name: inf_other Type: TEXT Description: Other infrastructure conflicts present
Column name: horz_plant Type: TEXT Description: Plantings present
Column name: trunk_dmg Type: TEXT Description: Describes specific damage or wounds found on the trunk
Column name: tree_loc Type: TEXT Description: Establishes the location of the tree in relation to the address provided
Column name: cncldist Type: NUMBER Description: New York City Council District tree point is in.
Column name: objectid Type: NUMBER
Column name: wire_prime Type: TEXT Description: Indicates the presence of primary wires
Column name: inf_shoes Type: TEXT Description: Sneakers present
Column name: x_sp Type: NUMBER Description: X field
Column name: objectid_1 Type: NUMBER
Column name: vert_pgrd Type: TEXT Description: Perimeter guard present
Column name: tree_dbh Type: NUMBER Description: The diameter of the tree in whole inches, measured at breast height. (4.5 feet from the ground.)
Column name: wire_htap Type: TEXT Description: Indicates the presence of house tap wires
Column name: y_sp Type: NUMBER Description: y field
Column name: horz_grate Type: TEXT Description: Tree grates present
Column name: boroname Type: TEXT Description: Borough tree is in, full text
Column name: zipcode Type: NUMBER Description: 2005 zipcode that the tree falls in.
Column name: horz_blck Type: TEXT Description: Block pavers present
Column name: cen_year Type: NUMBER Description: This is the year the tree was inventoried in. Data collection for the 2005 census spanned multiple seasons. Data is in YYYY format.
Column name: inf_outlet Type: TEXT Description: Electrical outlet present
